wn as urethral stricture.','The surgery involves removing or reconstructing the narrowed segment of the urethra to restore normal urine flow.','[{\"value\":\"Weak urine stream\"},{\"value\":\"Difficulty urinating\"},{\"value\":\"Frequent urinary infections\"},{\"value\":\"Incomplete bladder emptying\"},{\"value\":\"Pain or straining during urination\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Disease or structural problem for which Urethroplasty is commonly indicated\"},{\"value\":\"Progression of a chronic condition that no longer responds adequately to medicines alone\"},{\"value\":\"Acute complications such as infection, obstruction, bleeding, or severe inflammation\"},{\"value\":\"Congenital issues, trauma, or degenerative changes affecting normal function\"},{\"value\":\"Specialist assessment confirming that procedural treatment is the safest next step\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Bleeding after surgery\"},{\"value\":\"Infection risk\"},{\"value\":\"Recurrence of urethral stricture\"},{\"value\":\"Urinary leakage\"},{\"value\":\"Erectile dysfunction in rare cases\"}]','[]','[]','Urethroplasty restores urine flow by repairing urethral narrowing.','[]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Maintain catheter care properly\"},{\"value\":\"Drink adequate fluids regularly\"},{\"value\":\"Avoid heavy lifting temporarily\"},{\"value\":\"Take prescribed antibiotics and medications\"},{\"value\":\"Attend scheduled follow-up imaging\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Bleeding after surgery\"},{\"value\":\"Infection risk\"},{\"value\":\"Recurrence of urethral stricture\"},{\"value\":\"Urinary leakage\"},{\"value\":\"Erectile dysfunction in rare cases\"}]','Most patients experience improved urine flow and long-term relief after successful urethroplasty.','Urethroplasty effectively treats urethral stricture and restores urinary function.','Urethroplasty Surgery','Learn about urethroplasty for urethral stricture treatment.','urethroplasty, urethral stricture surgery',1,'2026-05-06 07:22:46','2026-07-29 00:28:08',NULL),(86,'Radical Prostatec