alue\":\"Difficulty walking independently\"},{\"value\":\"Poor balance and coordination\"},{\"value\":\"Leg weakness after surgery or injury\"},{\"value\":\"Pain while bearing weight\"},{\"value\":\"Increased risk of falls\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Disease or structural problem for which Walking Aids (Walker, Cane, Crutches) is commonly indicated\"},{\"value\":\"Progression of a chronic condition that no longer responds adequately to medicines alone\"},{\"value\":\"Acute complications such as infection, obstruction, bleeding, or severe inflammation\"},{\"value\":\"Congenital issues, trauma, or degenerative changes affecting normal function\"},{\"value\":\"Specialist assessment confirming that procedural treatment is the safest next step\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Improper use leading to falls\"},{\"value\":\"Arm or shoulder strain\"},{\"value\":\"Dependence on walking aids\"},{\"value\":\"Reduced confidence in mobility\"},{\"value\":\"Incorrect height adjustment causing discomfort\"}]','[]','[]','<p>Walking aids improve mobility and support safe recovery.</p>','[]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Learn proper walking techniques\"},{\"value\":\"Use the device consistently for safety\"},{\"value\":\"Check equipment condition regularly\"},{\"value\":\"Maintain good posture while walking\"},{\"value\":\"Follow rehabilitation exercises simultaneously\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Improper use leading to falls\"},{\"value\":\"Arm or shoulder strain\"},{\"value\":\"Dependence on walking aids\"},{\"value\":\"Reduced confidence in mobility\"},{\"value\":\"Incorrect height adjustment causing discomfort\"}]','<p>Walking aids improve independence and reduce fall risk.</p>','<p>Walking aids help patients regain safe mobility.</p>','Walking Aids for Orthopedic Recovery','Learn about walkers, canes, and crutches used in rehabilitation.','walking aids, crutches, walker, cane',1,'2026-05-12 06:08:48','2026-07-29 00:28:09',NULL),(130,'Heat and Cold Therapy','procedures/banners/0c69c802-c181-4b6b-9444-32ef7908436a.webp','procedures/banners/relatedimages/35a3d014-126e-4953-9fe1-425a49be8619.webp','heat-and-cold-therapy','<p>Heat and cold therapy are conservative treatments used to reduce pain, swelling, muscle spasms, and stiffness.</p>','<p>Cold therapy reduces inflammation while heat therapy improves circulation and relaxes muscles.</p>','[{\"value\":\"Swelling and inflammation\"},{\"value\":\"Muscle stiffness\"},{\"value\":\"Acute injury pain\"},{\"value\":\"Joint discomfort\"},{\"value\":\"Muscle spasms\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Underlying illness or injury requiring ongoing supportive care\"},{\"value\":\"Incomplete recovery after acute disease or surgery\"},{\"value\":\"Chronic symptoms needing structured rehabilitation or therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Lifestyle, occupational, or medical factors contributing to persistence\"},{\"value\":\"Specialist recommendation for Heat and Cold Therapy as part of comprehensive care\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Skin burns from excessive heat\"},{\"value\":\"Frostbite from prolonged cold exposure\"},{\"value\":\"Temporary numbness\"},{\"value\":\"Skin irritation\"},{\"value\":\"Ineffective treatment if used incorrectly\"}]','[]','[]','<p>Heat and cold therapy help relieve pain and swelling.</p>','[]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Apply therapy for recommended duration only\"},{\"value\":\"Protect skin with cloth barriers\"},{\"value\":\"Avoid sleeping during application\"},{\"value\":\"Alternate heat and cold if advised\"},{\"value\":\"Follow medical guidance for frequency\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Skin burns from excessive heat\"},{\"value\":\"Frostbite from prolonged cold exposure\"},{\"value\":\"Temporary numbness\"},{\"value\":\"Skin irritation\"},{\"value\":\"Ineffective treatment if used incorrectly\"}]','<p>Heat and cold therapy can improve comfort and symptom relief.</p>','<p>Heat and cold therapy support orthopedic recovery and pain management.</p>','Heat and Cold Therapy','Learn about heat and cold therapy for orthopedic pain relief.','heat therapy, cold therapy, or