ctively reduce pain and improve mobility.</p>','<p>IFT and TENS therapy support orthopedic rehabilitation and chronic pain management.</p>','IFT and TENS Therapy','Learn about IFT and TENS therapy for pain management.','IFT therapy, TENS therapy, pain stimulation therapy',1,'2026-05-12 06:08:49','2026-07-29 00:28:10',NULL),(133,'Traction Therapy','procedures/banners/18488857-f910-4830-b4ef-0c6d0ec976ab.webp','procedures/banners/relatedimages/a093e8fa-aff6-43c0-9d65-bffe077627d4.webp','traction-therapy','<p>Traction therapy is a treatment that gently stretches the spine or joints to relieve pressure on nerves and soft tissues.</p>','<p>This therapy is commonly used for cervical and lumbar spine conditions such as slipped discs and nerve compression.</p>','[{\"value\":\"Neck pain radiating to arms\"},{\"value\":\"Lower back pain\"},{\"value\":\"Numbness or tingling in limbs\"},{\"value\":\"Muscle tightness\"},{\"value\":\"Reduced spinal mobility\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Underlying illness or injury requiring ongoing supportive care\"},{\"value\":\"Incomplete recovery after acute disease or surgery\"},{\"value\":\"Chronic symptoms needing structured rehabilitation or therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Lifestyle, occupational, or medical factors contributing to persistence\"},{\"value\":\"Specialist recommendation for Traction Therapy as part of comprehensive care\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Temporary increase in pain\"},{\"value\":\"Muscle spasms\"},{\"value\":\"Dizziness after treatment\"},{\"value\":\"Nerve irritation in rare cases\"},{\"value\":\"Ineffectiveness in severe spinal instability\"}]','[]','[]','<p>Traction therapy helps reduce spinal pressure and improve alignment.</p>','[]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Follow therapy schedules regularly\"},{\"value\":\"Avoid sudden heavy lifting\"},{\"value\":\"Maintain proper posture\"},{\"value\":\"Perform strengthening exercises\"},{\"value\":\"Report worsening symptoms immediately\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Temporary increase in pain\"},{\"value\":\"Muscle spasms\"},{\"value\":\"Dizziness after treatment\"},{\"value\":\"Nerve irritation in rare cases\"},{\"value\":\"Ineffectiveness in severe spinal instability\"}]','<p>Traction therapy may improve spinal flexibility and reduce nerve compression.</p>','<p>Traction therapy supports spinal rehabilitation and pain relief.</p>','Traction Therapy','Learn about traction therapy for spinal pain and nerve compression.','traction therapy, spinal decompression, neck pain therapy',1,'2026-05-12 06:08:49','2026-07-29 00:28:10',NULL),(134,'Manual Therapy and Mobilization','procedures/banners/5cc80cab-1cef-4753-a5eb-df971a557f8e.webp','procedures/banners/relatedimages/981a28f0-12ae-45f8-b7ca-ccba646079ea.webp','manual-therapy-and-mobilization','<p>Manual therapy and mobilization are hands-on physiotherapy techniques used to improve joint movement, reduce pain, and restore musculoskeletal function.</p>','<p>These treatments involve controlled movements, stretching, and manipulation of joints and soft tissues performed by trained physiotherapists.</p>','[{\"value\":\"Joint stiffness and reduced flexibility\"},{\"value\":\"Muscle tightness and spasms\"},{\"value\":\"Neck and back pain\"},{\"value\":\"Limited range of motion\"},{\"value\":\"Difficulty performing daily activities\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Underlying illness or injury requiring ongoing supportive care\"},{\"value\":\"Incomplete recovery after acute disease or surgery\"},{\"value\":\"Chronic symptoms needing structured rehabilitation or therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Lifestyle, occupational, or medical factors contributing to persistence\"},{\"value\":\"Specialist recommendation for Manual Therapy and Mobilization as part of comprehensive care\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Temporary soreness after therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Mild swelling or discomfort\"},{\"value\":\"Muscle fatigue\"},{\"value\":\"Rare nerve irritation\"},{\"value\":\"Increased pain if excessive force is applied\"}]','[]','[]','<p>Manual therapy improves flexibility, joint mobility, and musculoskeletal function.</p>','[]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Follow stretching exercises regularly\"},{\"value\":\"Maintain correct posture and body mechanics\"},{\"value\":\"Avoid sudden strenuous activities\"},{\"value\":\"Stay hydrated after sessions\"},{\"value\":\"Attend follow-up physiotherapy appointments\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Temporary soreness after therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Mild swelling or discomfort\"},{\"value\":\"Muscle fatigue\"},{\"value\":\"Rare nerve irritation\"},{\"value\":\"Increased pain if excessive force is applied\"}]','<p>Manual therapy and mobilization can improve flexibility, reduce pain, and restore normal movement.</p>','<p>Manual therapy helps improve musculoskeletal function and mobility.</p>','Manual Therapy and Mobilization','Learn about manual therapy and mobilization for orthopedic rehabilitation.','manual therapy, mobilization therapy, physiotherapy',1,'2026-05-12 06:11:24','2026-07-29 00:28:10',NULL),(135,'Intra-Articular Steroid Injections','procedures/banners/e99741c4-fde8-4b81-870c-f2371084fb89.webp','procedures/banners/relatedimages/20763bc6-baa4-4746-9df4-67b567565913.webp','intra-articular-steroid-injections','<p>Intra-articular steroid injections involve injecting corticosteroid medication directly into a joint to reduce inflammation and pain.</p>','<p>These injections are commonly used for arthritis, joint inflammation, bursitis, and sports injuries.</p>','[{\"value\":\"Severe joint pain\"},{\"value\":\"Swelling and inflammation\"},{\"value\":\"Stiffness in affected joints\"},{\"value\":\"Difficulty walking or moving\"},{\"value\":\"Pain during physical activity\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Disease or structural problem for which Intra-Articular Steroid Injections is commonly indicated\"},{\"value\":\"Progression of a chronic condition that no longer responds adequately to medicines alone\"},{\"value\":\"Acute complications such as infection, obstruction, bleeding, or severe inflammation\"},{\"value\":\"Congenital issues, trauma, 