nseling','Sexual health counseling helps individuals and couples address sexual and emotional concerns.','Counseling includes emotional support, behavioral therapy, and treatment guidance.','[{\"value\":\"Anxiety related to sexual activity\"},{\"value\":\"Erectile or libido-related concerns\"},{\"value\":\"Relationship or intimacy problems\"},{\"value\":\"Reduced sexual satisfaction\"},{\"value\":\"Emotional stress affecting sexual health\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Underlying illness or injury requiring ongoing supportive care\"},{\"value\":\"Incomplete recovery after acute disease or surgery\"},{\"value\":\"Chronic symptoms needing structured rehabilitation or therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Lifestyle, occupational, or medical factors contributing to persistence\"},{\"value\":\"Specialist recommendation for Sexual Health Counseling as part of comprehensive care\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Emotional discomfort during discussions\"},{\"value\":\"Temporary increase in emotional sensitivity\"},{\"value\":\"Relationship tension during therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Need for long-term counseling\"},{\"value\":\"Delayed improvement in severe conditions\"}]','[]','[]','Counseling improves intimacy, emotional health, and sexual well-being.','[]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Attend counseling sessions regularly\"},{\"value\":\"Maintain open communication with partner\"},{\"value\":\"Practice recommended coping strategies\"},{\"value\":\"Follow therapist guidance consistently\"},{\"value\":\"Monitor emotional progress\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Emotional discomfort during discussions\"},{\"value\":\"Temporary increase in emotional sensitivity\"},{\"value\":\"Relationship tension during therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Need for long-term counseling\"},{\"value\":\"Delayed improvement in severe conditions\"}]','Counseling improves confidence, intimacy, and emotional well-being.','Sexual health counseling supports healthier relationships and emotional recovery.','Sexual Health Counseling','Learn about counseling for sexual and emoti