rictly\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Fever and flu-like symptoms\"},{\"value\":\"Bladder irritation\"},{\"value\":\"Blood in urine temporarily\"},{\"value\":\"Urinary tract infection\"},{\"value\":\"Rare systemic infection complications\"}]','BCG therapy significantly lowers recurrence of bladder cancer.','BCG immunotherapy is an effective bladder cancer treatment.','BCG Immunotherapy','Learn about BCG immunotherapy for bladder cancer.','BCG therapy, bladder cancer immunotherapy',1,'2026-05-12 10:28:19','2026-07-29 00:28:13',NULL),(176,'Palliative Urological Care','procedures/banners/628aef61-93dd-4e37-9d81-db2f02c56443.webp','procedures/banners/relatedimages/9489fb34-32d4-45c5-85f4-8b13e8856ba3.webp','palliative-urological-care','Palliative urological care focuses on comfort and quality of life in advanced disease.','Care includes symptom relief, emotional support, pain management, and supportive treatment.','[{\"value\":\"Severe chronic pain\"},{\"value\":\"Advanced cancer-related symptoms\"},{\"value\":\"Urinary obstruction or retention\"},{\"value\":\"Weakness and fatigue\"},{\"value\":\"Difficulty performing daily activities\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Disease or structural problem for which Palliative Urological Care is commonly indicated\"},{\"value\":\"Progression of a chronic condition that no longer responds adequately to medicines alone\"},{\"value\":\"Acute complications such as infection, obstruction, bleeding, or severe inflammation\"},{\"value\":\"Congenital issues, trauma, or degenerative changes affecting normal function\"},{\"value\":\"Specialist assessment confirming that procedural treatment is the safest next step\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Emotional stress for patient and family\"},{\"value\":\"Medication-related side effects\"},{\"value\":\"Reduced mobility and independence\"},{\"value\":\"Progressive disease complications\"},{\"value\":\"Nutritional and psychological decline\"}]','[]','[]','Palliative care improves comfort and symptom control in advanced disease.','[]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Follow pain management plans consistently\"},{\"value\":\"Maintain hydration and nutritional support\"},{\"value\":\"Attend regular medical and counseling visits\"},{\"value\":\"Monitor comfort and symptom progression\"},{\"value\":\"Seek emotional and family support services\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Emotional stress for patient and family\"},{\"value\":\"Medication-related side effects\"},{\"value\":\"Reduced mobility and independence\"},{\"value\":\"Progressive disease complications\"},{\"value\":\"Nutritional and psychological decline\"}]','Palliative care improves dignity, comfort, and emotional well-being.','Palliative urological care supports patients with advanced disease.','Palliative Urological Care','Learn about palliative care for advanced urological diseases.','palliative urology care, advanced cancer support',1,'2026-05-12 10:28:19','2026-07-29 00:28:14',NULL),(177,'Ultrasound KUB & Prostate',NULL,NULL,'ultrasound-kub-prostate','Ultrasound KUB & Prostate is a highly important diagnostic imaging test used in urology to evaluate the kidneys, ureters, urinary bladder, and prostate gland.','The test uses high-frequency sound waves to create real-time images of urinary structures without radiation exposure. It helps diagnose kidney stones, urinary obstruction, enlarged prostate, bladder abnormalities, infections, tumors, cysts, and urinary retention.','[{\"value\":\"Difficulty urinating\"},{\"value\":\"Blood in urine\"},{\"value\":\"Frequent urinary tract infections\"},{\"value\":\"Flank or abdominal pain\"},{\"value\":\"Weak urine stream or urinary retention\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Clinical suspicion of disease based on history and examination\"},{\"value\":\"Abnormal blood reports or previous investigation findings\"},{\"value\":\"Need to differentiate between similar conditions\"},{\"value\":\"Assessment before starting medical or surgical treatment\"},{\"value\":\"Follow-up of previously diagnosed disease or treatment response\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Minimal or no significant risk\"},{\"value\":\"Mild discomfort from full bladder preparation\"},{\"value\":\"Limited visibility in obese patients\"},{\"value\":\"Operator-dependent interpretation\"},{\"value\":\"Some small stones may not be clearly visible\"}]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Kidney size and structure assessment\"},{\"value\":\"Stone and hydronephrosis detection\"},{\"value\":\"Bladder wall evaluation\"},{\"value\":\"Residual urine measurement\"},{\"value\":\"Prostate volume assessment\"}]','During the procedure, a transducer is moved across the abdomen after applying ultrasound gel. Sound waves generate detailed images of the urinary tract and prostate.','[]','[{\"value\":\"The procedure usually takes 15\\u201330 minutes\"},{\"value\":\"No hospitalization is required\"},{\"value\":\"Patients can return to routine activities immediately\"},{\"value\":\"Results are reviewed shortly after scanning\"},{\"value\":\"Further tests may be recommended if abnormalities are found\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Resume normal activities immediately\"},{\"value\":\"Drink adequate fluids after the scan\"},{\"value\":\"Follow doctor\\u2019s advice regarding results\"},{\"value\":\"Undergo further testing if recommended\"},{\"value\":\"Maintain regular follow-up evaluations\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Minimal or no significant risk\"},{\"value\":\"Mild discomfort from full bladder preparation\"},{\"value\":\"Limited visibility in obese patients\"},{\"value\":\"Operator-dependent interpretation\"},{\"value\":\"Some small stones may not be clearly visible\"}]','Ultrasound KUB & Prostate is highly valuable for long-term monitoring of urinary disorders because it is safe, repeatable, radiation-free, and cost-effective.','Ultrasound KUB & Prostate remains one of the most reliable diagnostic investigations in modern urology.','Ultrasound KUB & Prostate','Learn about Ultrasound KUB & Prostate imaging for urinary tract and prostate evaluation.','Ultrasound KUB, prostate ultrasound, urinary imaging',1,'2026-05-15 06:12:01','2026-07-29 00:28:14',NULL),(178,'CT Urography Access','procedures/banners/bc2bc844-d27b-4819-9941-d1ceffd795af.webp','procedures/banners/relatedimages/036070f8-7537-460e-83c1-62f6f748753d.webp','ct-urography-access','<p>CT Urography is an advanced radiological imaging facility that provides detailed cross-sectional images of the kidneys, ureters, bladder, and surrounding urinary structures.</p>','<p>The imaging technique uses computed tomography and contrast dye to evaluate kidney stones, urinary tract tumors, hematuria, obstruction, congenital abnormalities, and infections.</p>','[{\"value\":\"Blood in urine\"},{\"value\":\"Severe flank pain\"},{\"value\":\"Suspected urinary tract tumors\"},{\"value\":\"Recurrent urinary infections\"},{\"value\":\"Kidney stone symptoms\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Clinical suspicion of disease based on history and examination\"},{\"value\":\"Abnormal blood reports or previous investigation findings\"},{\"value\":\"Need to differentiate between similar conditions\"},{\"value\":\"Assessment before starting medical or surgical treatment\"},{\"value\":\"Follow-up of previously diagnosed disease or treatment response\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Radiation exposure\"},{\"value\":\"Contrast dye allergy\"},{\"value\":\"Temporary nausea after contrast injection\"},{\"value\":\"Kidney strain in vulnerable patients\"},{\"value\":\"Claustrophobia or anxiety during scanning\"}]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Cross-sectional urinary tract imaging\"},{\"value\":\"Contrast-enhanced urinary evaluation\"},{\"value\":\"Urinary obstruction detection\"},{\"value\":\"Tumor identification\"},{\"value\":\"Urinary anatomy visualization\"}]','<p>The patient lies on a CT table while the scanner captures detailed images. Contrast dye is commonly injected intravenously for enhanced urinary tract visualization.</p>','[]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Drink extra fluids after contrast studies\"},{\"value\":\"Monitor for allergic reactions\"},{\"value\":\"Follow kidney function precautions if advised\"},{\"value\":\"Resume routine activities unless otherwise instructed\"},{\"value\":\"Attend follow-up consultation for report review\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Radiation exposure\"},{\"value\":\"Contrast dye allergy\"},{\"value\":\"Temporary nausea after contrast injection\"},{\"value\":\"Kidney strain in vulnerable patients\"},{\"value\":\"Claustrophobia or anxiety during scanning\"}]','<p>CT urography significantly improves early detection of urinary diseases and supports accurate treatment planning.</p>','<p>CT urography remains one of the most accurate diagnostic imaging techniques in modern urology.</p>','CT Urography','Learn about CT urography imaging for urinary tract evaluation.','CT urography, kidney CT scan, urinary tract imaging',1,'2026-05-15 06:12:01','2026-07-29 00:28:14',NULL),(179,'Uroflowmetry Equipment','procedures/banners/94f1ce14-f3b9-4752-bd74-2b5268c8e410.webp','procedures/banners/relatedimages/213bad5d-c02a-4691-979a-3ab31737806e.webp','uroflowmetry-equipment','<p>Uroflowmetry equipment is a computerized system used to measure urine flow rate, volume, and urination patterns.</p>','<p>The test evaluates bladder and urethral function in patients with urinary obstruction, enlarged prostate, urethral strictures, and bladder dysfunction.</p>','[{\"value\":\"Weak urine stream\"},{\"value\":\"Difficulty starting urination\"},{\"value\":\"Interrupted urine flow\"},{\"value\":\"Incomplete bladder emptying\"},{\"value\":\"Frequent urination problems\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Disease or structural problem for which Uroflowmetry Equipment is commonly indicated\"},{\"value\":\"Progression of a chronic condition that no longer responds adequately to medicines alone\"},{\"value\":\"Acute complications such as infection, obstruction, bleeding, or severe inflammation\"},{\"value\":\"Congenital issues, trauma, or degenerative changes affecting normal function\"},{\"value\":\"Specialist assessment confirming that procedural treatment is the safest next step\"}]','[{\"value\":\"No major physical risks\"},{\"value\":\"Anxiety affecting test accuracy\"},{\"value\":\"Need for repeat testing if bladder not full\"},{\"value\":\"Temporary embarrassment in some patients\"},{\"value\":\"Incomplete results if urination is insufficient\"}]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Urine flow speed analysis\"},{\"value\":\"Total urine volume measurement\"},{\"value\":\"Flow pattern assessment\"},{\"value\":\"Urination duration evaluation\"},{\"value\":\"Residual urine assessment\"}]','<p>The patient urinates into a specialized device connected to sensors that generate graphical and numerical flow data.</p>','[]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Resume normal activities immediately\"},{\"value\":\"Maintain proper hydration\"},{\"value\":\"Discuss results with urologist\"},{\"value\":\"Follow additional testing recommendations\"},{\"value\":\"Continue regular urinary monitoring\"}]','[{\"value\":\"No major physical risks\"},{\"value\":\"Anxiety affecting test accuracy\"},{\"value\":\"Need for repeat testing if bladder not full\"},{\"value\":\"Temporary embarrassment in some patients\"},{\"value\":\"Incomplete results if urination is insufficient\"}]','<p>Uroflowmetry is an essential tool for long-term monitoring of urinary disorders and treatment outcomes.</p>','<p>Uroflowmetry is a safe and highly useful investigation in modern outpatient urology.</p>','Uroflowmetry Equipment','Learn about uroflowmetry testing for urinary flow analysis.','uroflowmetry, urinary flow test, bladder evaluation',1,'2026-05-15 06:12:01','2026-07-29 00:28:14',NULL),(180,'Urodynamic Study Systems','procedures/banners/46815a70-e325-4b02-9b4a-a47f3e1be403.webp','procedures/banners/relatedimages/e721da5f-bf64-4733-927b-1a2e4ebce196.webp','urodynamic-study-systems','<p>Urodynamic study systems are advanced diagnostic platforms used to evaluate bladder pressure, urinary control, and urine storage and emptying functions.</p>','<p>These systems assess how the bladder, urethra, pelvic