ms are essential for diagnosing complex urinary disorders.</p>','Urodynamic Study Systems','Learn about urodynamic testing systems for bladder function analysis.','urodynamic study, bladder pressure testing',1,'2026-05-15 06:12:01','2026-07-29 00:28:14',NULL),(181,'Cystoscopy & Endourology Tower',NULL,NULL,'cystoscopy-endourology-tower','A cystoscopy and endourology tower is an integrated equipment system used for minimally invasive urological diagnosis and surgery.','The tower includes HD cameras, monitors, light sources, irrigation systems, and endoscopic instruments for urinary tract procedures.','[{\"value\":\"Blood in urine\"},{\"value\":\"Kidney stones\"},{\"value\":\"Urinary obstruction\"},{\"value\":\"Bladder tumors\"},{\"value\":\"Recurrent urinary infections\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Disease or structural problem for which Cystoscopy & Endourology Tower is commonly indicated\"},{\"value\":\"Progression of a chronic condition that no longer responds adequately to medicines alone\"},{\"value\":\"Acute complications such as infection, obstruction, bleeding, or severe inflammation\"},{\"value\":\"Congenital issues, trauma, or degenerative changes affecting normal function\"},{\"value\":\"Specialist assessment confirming that procedural treatment is the safest next step\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Infection during procedures\"},{\"value\":\"Bleeding after intervention\"},{\"value\":\"Temporary urinary discomfort\"},{\"value\":\"Rare urinary tract injury\"},{\"value\":\"Equipment malfunction risks\"}]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Cystoscopy\"},{\"value\":\"Ureteroscopy\"},{\"value\":\"Bladder biopsy\"},{\"value\":\"Stone visualization\"},{\"value\":\"Tumor inspection\"}]','The system supports minimally invasive procedures including TURP, TURBT, laser procedures, and stone surgery.','[{\"name\":\"Cystoscopy\",\"description\":\"Direct visualization of bladder and urethra\"},{\"name\":\"Ureteroscopy\",\"description\":\"Endoscopic urinary tract evaluation\"},{\"name\":\"Laser Procedures\",\"description\":\"Laser-assisted minimally invasive treatments\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Recovery depends on the procedure performed\"},{\"value\":\"Most procedures allow faster recovery\"},{\"value\":\"Hospital stay is generally shorter\"},{\"value\":\"Patients resume activities earlier\"},{\"value\":\"Follow-up evaluation is commonly recommended\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Maintain strict equipment sterilization\"},{\"value\":\"Monitor patient recovery carefully\"},{\"value\":\"Follow infection control protocols\"},{\"value\":\"Schedule equipment maintenance regularly\"},{\"value\":\"Document all procedures properly\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Infection during procedures\"},{\"value\":\"Bleeding after intervention\"},{\"value\":\"Temporary urinary discomfort\"},{\"value\":\"Rare urinary tract injury\"},{\"value\":\"Equipment malfunction risks\"}]','Endourology towers have transformed minimally invasive urological surgery with improved visualization and recovery.','Cystoscopy and endourology towers are essential in modern urology practice.','Cystoscopy & Endourology Tower','Learn about cystoscopy and endourology systems.','cystoscopy tower, endourology equipment',1,'2026-05-15 06:12:01','2026-07-29 00:28:15',NULL),(182,'TURP / TURBT Equipment','procedures/banners/5bdf6d6f-76d6-491a-b88b-25593820b27f.webp','procedures/banners/relatedimages/e8aede40-090c-45cb-a670-de9e7162fdf8.webp','turp-turbt-equipment','<p>TURP / TURBT equipment refers to specialized endoscopic systems used for Transurethral Resection of the Prostate and Transurethral Resection of Bladder Tumors.</p>','<p>These systems allow minimally invasive prostate and bladder surgery through the natural urinary passage without external incisions.</p>','[{\"value\":\"Difficulty urinating\"},{\"value\":\"Weak urine stream\"},{\"value\":\"Blood in urine\"},{\"value\":\"Frequent urination\"},{\"value\":\"Bladder tumor symptoms\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Disease or structural problem for which TURP \\/ TURBT Equipment is commonly indicated\