rapy helps control seizures\"},{\"value\":\"Neurological monitoring continues during recovery\"},{\"value\":\"Follow-up care reduces seizure recurrence\"},{\"value\":\"Long-term developmental monitoring supports neurological health\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Take medications regularly as prescribed\"},{\"value\":\"Maintain seizure safety precautions\"},{\"value\":\"Monitor seizure frequency carefully\"},{\"value\":\"Attend neurological follow-up appointments\"},{\"value\":\"Ensure adequate sleep and stress management\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Brain injury from prolonged seizures\"},{\"value\":\"Breathing difficulties during seizures\"},{\"value\":\"Physical injuries during convulsions\"},{\"value\":\"Developmental complications\"},{\"value\":\"Recurring seizure episodes\"}]','Many children achieve good seizure control with early diagnosis and proper treatment.','Seizure management is essential for preventing neurological complications and improving long-term outcomes.','Seizure Management','Learn about pediatric seizure diagnosis, treatment, and neurological care.','seizure management, pediatric neurology, epilepsy treatment',1,'2026-05-15 10:33:29','2026-07-29 00:28:18',NULL),(218,'Antiepileptic Drug Therapy',NULL,NULL,'antiepileptic-drug-therapy','Antiepileptic drug therapy is a specialized neurological treatment used to prevent and control seizures in children diagnosed with epilepsy or recurrent seizure disorders.','These medications work by stabilizing abnormal electrical activity in the brain and reducing seizure frequency and severity.','[{\"value\":\"Recurrent seizures\"},{\"value\":\"Epilepsy diagnosis\"},{\"value\":\"Convulsive episodes\"},{\"value\":\"Neurological instability\"},{\"value\":\"Abnormal EEG findings\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Underlying illness or injury requiring ongoing supportive care\"},{\"value\":\"Incomplete recovery after acute disease or surgery\"},{\"value\":\"Chronic symptoms needing structured rehabilitation or therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Lifestyle, occu