ions',1,'2026-05-15 10:33:29','2026-07-29 00:28:18',NULL),(219,'Pediatric Neurology Referral',NULL,NULL,'pediatric-neurology-referral','Pediatric neurology referral is a specialized healthcare service that connects children with neurological symptoms or disorders to pediatric neurologists for advanced evaluation and treatment.','Neurological problems in children may affect brain function, movement, development, behavior, learning, speech, and muscle coordination.','[{\"value\":\"Recurrent seizures\"},{\"value\":\"Delayed development\"},{\"value\":\"Abnormal movements\"},{\"value\":\"Persistent headaches\"},{\"value\":\"Muscle weakness or coordination problems\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Disease or structural problem for which Pediatric Neurology Referral is commonly indicated\"},{\"value\":\"Progression of a chronic condition that no longer responds adequately to medicines alone\"},{\"value\":\"Acute complications such as infection, obstruction, bleeding, or severe inflammation\"},{\"value\":\"Congenital issues, trauma, or degenerative changes affecting normal function\"},{\"value\":\"Specialist assessment confirming that procedural treatment is the safest next step\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Delayed diagnosis of neurological disease\"},{\"value\":\"Developmental complications\"},{\"value\":\"Learning difficulties\"},{\"value\":\"Progressive neurological impairment\"},{\"value\":\"Reduced quality of life if untreated\"}]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Neurological examinations\"},{\"value\":\"EEG studies\"},{\"value\":\"MRI scans\"},{\"value\":\"Developmental assessments\"},{\"value\":\"Genetic evaluations\"}]','Children may be referred for seizures, epilepsy, developmental delay, muscle weakness, headaches, behavioral changes, cerebral palsy, and neuromuscular disorders.','[]','[{\"value\":\"Initial neurological evaluation identifies underlying conditions\"},{\"value\":\"Advanced investigations support diagnosis\"},{\"value\":\"Therapy and rehabilitation begin after referral\"},{\"value\":