comes improve gradually\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Continue educational support programs\"},{\"value\":\"Attend therapy and counseling sessions\"},{\"value\":\"Encourage structured learning activities\"},{\"value\":\"Maintain communication with teachers\"},{\"value\":\"Monitor academic progress regularly\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Academic underachievement\"},{\"value\":\"Low self-confidence\"},{\"value\":\"Emotional stress\"},{\"value\":\"Social difficulties\"},{\"value\":\"School avoidance or behavioral issues\"}]','Early identification and educational intervention significantly improve learning ability, confidence, and academic performance.','Learning difficulty assessment supports better educational and developmental outcomes in children.','Learning Difficulty Assessment','Learn about pediatric learning difficulty assessment and educational support.','learning disability assessment, educational therapy, developmental evaluation',1,'2026-05-15 10:35:08','2026-07-29 00:28:19',NULL),(222,'Pediatric Psychology Services',NULL,NULL,'pediatric-psychology-services','Pediatric psychology services are specialized mental health services designed to support the emotional, behavioral, cognitive, and social well-being of children and adolescents.','These services help children cope with emotional stress, anxiety, developmental challenges, trauma, behavioral disorders, chronic illness, and school-related difficulties.','[{\"value\":\"Anxiety or excessive fear\"},{\"value\":\"Emotional outbursts\"},{\"value\":\"Behavioral changes\"},{\"value\":\"Social withdrawal\"},{\"value\":\"Difficulty coping with stress\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Disease or structural problem for which Pediatric Psychology Services is commonly indicated\"},{\"value\":\"Progression of a chronic condition that no longer responds adequately to medicines alone\"},{\"value\":\"Acute complications such as infection, obstruction, bleeding, or severe inflammation\"},{\"value\":\"Congenital issues, trauma, or degenerative changes affec