gement of Urinary Tract Infections',NULL,NULL,'management-of-urinary-tract-infections','Management of urinary tract infections is a pediatric healthcare service focused on diagnosing, treating, and preventing infections affecting the urinary system.','UTIs are common in children and may cause discomfort, fever, poor feeding, and kidney complications if untreated.','[{\"value\":\"Painful urination\"},{\"value\":\"Fever without obvious cause\"},{\"value\":\"Frequent urination\"},{\"value\":\"Abdominal or back pain\"},{\"value\":\"Foul-smelling urine\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Underlying illness or injury requiring ongoing supportive care\"},{\"value\":\"Incomplete recovery after acute disease or surgery\"},{\"value\":\"Chronic symptoms needing structured rehabilitation or therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Lifestyle, occupational, or medical factors contributing to persistence\"},{\"value\":\"Specialist recommendation for Management of Urinary Tract Infections as part of comprehensive care\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Kidney infection\"},{\"value\":\"Recurrent UTIs\"},{\"value\":\"Kidney scarring\"},{\"value\":\"Dehydration\"},{\"value\":\"Urinary complications\"}]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Urine analysis\"},{\"value\":\"Urine culture\"},{\"value\":\"Physical examination\"},{\"value\":\"Kidney imaging\"},{\"value\":\"Hydration assessment\"}]','Treatment commonly involves antibiotic therapy, fever management, hydration support, and follow-up urine testing.','[]','[{\"value\":\"Urine testing confirms infection diagnosis\"},{\"value\":\"Antibiotic therapy begins promptly\"},{\"value\":\"Symptoms improve gradually with treatment\"},{\"value\":\"Follow-up urine testing monitors recovery\"},{\"value\":\"Long-term monitoring prevents recurrent infections\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Complete prescribed antibiotics fully\"},{\"value\":\"Encourage adequate fluid intake\"},{\"value\":\"Maintain proper hygiene practices\"},{\"value\":\"Attend follow-up urine evaluations\"},{\"value\":\"Monitor for recurrent symptoms\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Kidney infection\"},{\"value\":\"Recurrent UTIs\"},{\"value\":\"Kidney scarring\"},{\"value\":\"Dehydration\"},{\"value\":\"Urinary complications\"}]','Most pediatric UTIs recover completely with early treatment and monitoring.','Early UTI management helps prevent kidney complications and supports healthy urinary function.','Management of Urinary Tract Infections','Learn about pediatric urinary tract infection diagnosis and treatment.','UTI treatment, pediatric urinary infections, urinary tract infection management',1,'2026-05-15 10:35:08','2026-07-29 00:28:19',NULL),(224,'Enuresis Management Program',NULL,NULL,'enuresis-management-program','An enuresis management program is a pediatric healthcare service designed to help children who experience involuntary urination, especially bedwetting during sleep.','Enuresis is common in childhood and may occur due to delayed bladder maturity, deep sleep patterns, emotional stress, urinary problems, or genetic factors.','[{\"value\":\"Bedwetting during sleep\"},{\"value\":\"Frequent nighttime urination\"},{\"value\":\"Daytime urinary accidents\"},{\"value\":\"Emotional embarrassment\"},{\"value\":\"Delayed bladder control\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Underlying illness or injury requiring ongoing supportive care\"},{\"value\":\"Incomplete recovery after acute disease or surgery\"},{\"value\":\"Chronic symptoms needing structured rehabilitation or therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Lifestyle, occupational, or medical factors contributing to persistence\"},{\"value\":\"Specialist recommendation for Enuresis Management Program as part of comprehensive care\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Low self-esteem\"},{\"value\":\"Anxiety and embarrassment\"},{\"value\":\"Sleep disturbances\"},{\"value\":\"Social difficulties\"},{\"value\":\"Underlying urinary disorders\"}]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Medical history review\"},{\"value\":\"Bladder function evaluation\"},{\"value\":\"Urine testing\"},{\"value\":\"Sleep assessment\"},{\"value\":\"Psychological screening\"}]','Management strategies may include bladder training exercises, bedwetting alarms, fluid management guidance, behavioral therapy, and medication therapy in selected cases.','[]','[{\"value\":\"Initial evaluation identifies bladder control issues\"},{\"value\":\"Behavioral and bladder training begin early\"},{\"value\":\"Regular monitoring improves symptom control\"},{\"value\":\"Emotional support improves confidence\"},{\"value\":\"Long-term follow-up supports bladder maturity\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Follow bladder training schedules consistently\"},{\"value\":\"Encourage positive reinforcement techniques\"},{\"value\":\"Limit excessive nighttime fluids if advised\"},{\"value\":\"Monitor urinary patterns regularly\"},{\"value\":\"Attend follow-up pediatric evaluations\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Low self-esteem\"},{\"value\":\"Anxiety and embarrassment\"},{\"value\":\"Sleep disturbances\"},{\"value\":\"Social difficulties\"},{\"value\":\"Underlying urinary disorders\"}]','Most children gradually achieve normal bladder control with supportive treatment and developmental maturity.','Enuresis management programs help improve bladder control, confidence, and emotional well-being in children.','Enuresis Management Program','Learn about pediatric enuresis management and bedwetting treatment programs.','bedwetting treatment, enuresis management, pediatric bladder control',1,'2026-05-15 10:35:08','2026-07-29 00:28:19',NULL),(225,'Immunization and Vaccination Services',NULL,NULL,'immunization-and-vaccination-services','Immunization and vaccination services are preventive pediatric healthcare programs designed to protect children from serious infectious diseases through scheduled vaccines.','Vaccination helps the body develop immunity against harmful infections and has greatly reduced childhood illness, disability, and mortality worldwide.','[{\"value\":\"Need for routine childhood vaccination\"},{\"value\":\"Exposure risk to infectious diseases\"},{\"value\":\"Delayed immuniz