\":\"Missed vaccination complications\"},{\"value\":\"Temporary irritability in children\"}]','Vaccination programs have dramatically reduced childhood mortality and prevented millions of infectious disease cases globally.','Immunization and vaccination services are essential for preventing serious childhood infections and improving public health.','Immunization and Vaccination Services','Learn about pediatric immunization and vaccination services for children.','vaccination services, immunization program, pediatric vaccines',1,'2026-05-15 11:23:22','2026-07-29 00:28:19',NULL),(226,'Neonatal Care Services',NULL,NULL,'neonatal-care-services','Neonatal care services provide specialized medical care for newborn babies, especially premature infants, low birth weight babies, and newborns with medical complications.','The neonatal period is highly sensitive because newborns require careful monitoring of breathing, feeding, temperature, infection risk, and overall adaptation after birth.','[{\"value\":\"Premature birth complications\"},{\"value\":\"Breathing difficulty after birth\"},{\"value\":\"Poor feeding\"},{\"value\":\"Low birth weight\"},{\"value\":\"Neonatal infection signs\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Disease or structural problem for which Neonatal Care Services is commonly indicated\"},{\"value\":\"Progression of a chronic condition that no longer responds adequately to medicines alone\"},{\"value\":\"Acute complications such as infection, obstruction, bleeding, or severe inflammation\"},{\"value\":\"Congenital issues, trauma, or degenerative changes affecting normal function\"},{\"value\":\"Specialist assessment confirming that procedural treatment is the safest next step\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Respiratory complications\"},{\"value\":\"Neonatal infections\"},{\"value\":\"Developmental delays\"},{\"value\":\"Feeding difficulties\"},{\"value\":\"Temperature instability\"}]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Vital sign monitoring\"},{\"value\":\"Growth assessment\"},{\"value\":\"Neurological evaluation\"},{\"value\":\"Feeding tolerance assessment\"},{\"value\":\"Infection screening\"}]','The service includes newborn monitoring units, incubators, oxygen therapy, feeding support, infection management, phototherapy systems, neonatal resuscitation equipment, and trained neonatal specialists.','[]','[{\"value\":\"Neonatal stabilization begins immediately after birth\"},{\"value\":\"Continuous monitoring supports safe recovery\"},{\"value\":\"Feeding and respiratory support improve gradually\"},{\"value\":\"Growth and neurological monitoring continue regularly\"},{\"value\":\"Long-term follow-up supports healthy development\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Maintain regular neonatal follow-up visits\"},{\"value\":\"Support breastfeeding and nutrition\"},{\"value\":\"Monitor growth and development carefully\"},{\"value\":\"Prevent infection exposure\"},{\"value\":\"Continue immunization schedules\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Respiratory complications\"},{\"value\":\"Neonatal infections\"},{\"value\":\"Developmental delays\"},{\"value\":\"Feeding difficulties\"},{\"value\":\"Temperature instability\"}]','Advanced neonatal care services significantly improve survival and developmental outcomes in vulnerable newborns.','Neonatal care services are essential for improving newborn survival and long-term health outcomes.','Neonatal Care Services','Learn about specialized neonatal care services for newborn babies.','neonatal care, newborn healthcare, neonatal treatment',1,'2026-05-15 11:23:22','2026-07-29 00:28:19',NULL),(227,'Newborn Screening',NULL,NULL,'newborn-screening','Newborn screening is a preventive healthcare program designed to detect serious genetic, metabolic, hormonal, hearing, and developmental disorders in babies shortly after birth.','Early identification of these conditions allows immediate treatment before symptoms develop, preventing severe disability, developmental delay, or life-threatening complications.','[{\"value\":\"Need for preventive newborn evaluation\"},{\