rove early disease detection and reduce long-term disability in children.','Newborn screening supports early diagnosis and prevention of severe childhood complications.','Newborn Screening','Learn about newborn screening and preventive neonatal healthcare programs.','newborn screening, neonatal diagnostics, preventive newborn care',1,'2026-05-15 11:23:22','2026-07-29 00:28:19',NULL),(228,'Management of Neonatal Jaundice',NULL,NULL,'management-of-neonatal-jaundice','Management of neonatal jaundice is a specialized neonatal healthcare service focused on diagnosing, monitoring, and treating elevated bilirubin levels in newborn babies.','Neonatal jaundice causes yellow discoloration of the skin and eyes and is extremely common during the first days of life.','[{\"value\":\"Yellow discoloration of skin and eyes\"},{\"value\":\"Poor feeding\"},{\"value\":\"Excessive sleepiness\"},{\"value\":\"Irritability\"},{\"value\":\"High bilirubin levels\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Underlying illness or injury requiring ongoing supportive care\"},{\"value\":\"Incomplete recovery after acute disease or surgery\"},{\"value\":\"Chronic symptoms needing structured rehabilitation or therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Lifestyle, occupational, or medical factors contributing to persistence\"},{\"value\":\"Specialist recommendation for Management of Neonatal Jaundice as part of comprehensive care\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Severe bilirubin toxicity\"},{\"value\":\"Brain damage (kernicterus)\"},{\"value\":\"Feeding difficulties\"},{\"value\":\"Dehydration\"},{\"value\":\"Neurological complications\"}]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Bilirubin testing\"},{\"value\":\"Physical examination\"},{\"value\":\"Feeding assessment\"},{\"value\":\"Neurological monitoring\"},{\"value\":\"Hydration evaluation\"}]','Treatment options may include frequent feeding support, phototherapy, IV fluids, exchange transfusion in severe cases, and monitoring for underlying disease.','[]','[{\"value\":\"Jaundice evaluation begins shortly after symptoms a