ry.','Head Injury Observation and Management','Learn about pediatric head injury evaluation and emergency neurological management.','head injury management, pediatric trauma care, brain injury observation',1,'2026-05-15 11:24:23','2026-07-29 00:28:19',NULL),(230,'Pediatric Physiotherapy',NULL,NULL,'pediatric-physiotherapy','Pediatric physiotherapy is a specialized rehabilitation service designed to improve movement, strength, balance, posture, coordination, and physical function in children with developmental, neurological, orthopedic, or muscular conditions.','The therapy supports children in achieving age-appropriate motor skills and improving independence in daily activities.','[{\"value\":\"Delayed walking or motor milestones\"},{\"value\":\"Muscle weakness\"},{\"value\":\"Poor balance or coordination\"},{\"value\":\"Difficulty with movement\"},{\"value\":\"Abnormal posture or gait\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Underlying illness or injury requiring ongoing supportive care\"},{\"value\":\"Incomplete recovery after acute disease or surgery\"},{\"value\":\"Chronic symptoms needing structured rehabilitation or therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Lifestyle, occupational, or medical factors contributing to persistence\"},{\"value\":\"Specialist recommendation for Pediatric Physiotherapy as part of comprehensive care\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Slow progress in severe conditions\"},{\"value\":\"Muscle stiffness or discomfort\"},{\"value\":\"Reduced mobility without therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Therapy non-compliance\"},{\"value\":\"Delayed functional recovery\"}]','[]','[{\"value\":\"Motor skill assessment\"},{\"value\":\"Muscle strength evaluation\"},{\"value\":\"Balance and coordination testing\"},{\"value\":\"Postural assessment\"},{\"value\":\"Mobility evaluation\"}]','The therapy program may include muscle strengthening exercises, balance and coordination training, walking and mobility exercises, stretching techniques, postural correction, and neurodevelopmental therapy.','[]','[{\"value\":\"Initial physiotherapy assessment identifies functional limitations\"},{\"value\":\"Regular therapy sessions improve mobility gradually\"},{\"value\":\"Strength and coordination improve with exercises\"},{\"value\":\"Long-term rehabilitation supports independence\"},{\"value\":\"Developmental progress improves with continued therapy\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Continue home exercise programs regularly\"},{\"value\":\"Attend physiotherapy sessions consistently\"},{\"value\":\"Encourage physical activity safely\"},{\"value\":\"Monitor developmental improvements\"},{\"value\":\"Maintain supportive rehabilitation environments\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Slow progress in severe conditions\"},{\"value\":\"Muscle stiffness or discomfort\"},{\"value\":\"Reduced mobility without therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Therapy non-compliance\"},{\"value\":\"Delayed functional recovery\"}]','Pediatric physiotherapy greatly improves mobility, muscle function, independence, and quality of life in children with physical challenges.','Early pediatric physiotherapy intervention helps maximize long-term physical and developmental potential.','Pediatric Physiotherapy','Learn about pediatric physiotherapy and rehabilitation services for children.','pediatric physiotherapy, child rehabilitation, developmental therapy',1,'2026-05-15 11:24:23','2026-07-29 00:28:20',NULL),(231,'Autism Evaluation and Early Intervention Referral','procedures/banners/6f854812-8653-439b-ba60-8cd462ac0516.webp',NULL,'autism-evaluation-and-early-intervention-referral','<p>Autism evaluation and early intervention referral is a pediatric developmental healthcare service focused on identifying autism spectrum disorder (ASD) early and connecting children with specialized therapies and support programs.</p>','<p>Autism affects communication, social interaction, behavior, and sensory processing. Early diagnosis is extremely important because early intervention can significantly improve developmental outcomes.</p>','[{\"value\":\"Delayed speech developmen